{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:837387855f6ad61d005a5127fd8683a18579a6b552d15c1494a7fd6863205b61",
      "text": "彩排结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4908d888c9d417e88a370a6ee9f14184dd7c819d03f02e315c37a7249abb050a",
      "text": "嗯……刚才那几个偶像，\n样子感觉有点怪怪的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc598839717afa78b674e57c914d37da1403bc77fda998f7d25f7c0f1c72bff6",
      "text": "你们刚才聊天的那些人？嗯，彩排时\n感觉也挺没精神的呢。不要紧吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2661ddc21d35d45fbd4f911c5cfdef9925e289853035523f7daa33020a18b330",
      "text": "…不只是那几个偶像。\n整体的气氛都沉甸甸的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e66bb463c2e419e7648ddb311e31bafe9eb115da69e4ac08ad77dd362dac58ec",
      "text": "…应该是受到了刚才制作人提到的\n节目存续问题的影响吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b38ecde5197f6f3bb0be28c1286eb07c3a28f474570bff9d0dc9eab2e709c06",
      "text": "…说来简单，\n人的情绪这种东西是会传染的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7010f15398efd19183b1cf1ddad4f97c0c6b05e8c2be75642c81be60cfb0ab0f",
      "text": "…特别是“悲伤、痛苦”这种负面情绪，\n比起“幸福”，人们更容易反反复复去回想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:303e5e1064b10b4dbbcaaa983097a02d855b6a3c9153d8ec47d6fe4f1493a307",
      "text": "…因此，据说也更容易残留在人的心里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:814704b89419aebec377098d436fe84cbed911ef2fe04772c53c4c1b85bffdcf",
      "text": "那么……只要我们保持快乐的心情，\n这份快乐也会传染给现场吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7e4aee581e0cd0d18882ea1cc3c9291b660a4e4e1e8f56fc0fb1562a96a5def",
      "text": "接下来就是正式演出了，时间紧迫，\n能做的事情也许很有限……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4f70313b947ce970726c9804c8ed38276419a83078945b8829fe3f80214a01c",
      "text": "没那回事，凉。光靠正式演出就足够了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d2caab213701e44c587c79ebf7304ae9da8195ca54140aaf6f6cff96f78b0f9",
      "text": "我们原本的打算，就是去唱歌、跳舞、热热闹闹地聊天，\n让镜头另一头的所有人露出笑容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ccf26bd21aa96aa3191deb6cdf6e92815e9651ba58417f98480363346cdfb5d",
      "text": "只是变成了把镜头这边的所有人\n也一并逗笑而已嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9279309c1d083829cdbe6547702fba6e73d11e24804bc832e1b6624b4ecdb17",
      "text": "不过是人数稍微变多了点，完全不用担心！\n所以，笑着走向舞台吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a2bf5202f14ed6c3f63affa58c258d2ca1c2a38eb9d9c41d2c923ffbb6b0b69",
      "text": "大吾君……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_f:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b58b9541cead08cd941d41d95d40b39ced8250c4baaa7e19635b6c9a7d81e65",
      "text": "呵呵，太有说服力了。\n看到大吾君刚才的笑容，我也涌起自信了！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
